        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": "$2^x<2$ 的解集是 $(-\\infty,1)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "F",
          "text": "$2^x<2$ 的解集是 $(-\\infty,1]$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q687-changes",
    "source_numbers": [
      "687"
    ],
    "view": {
      "mode": "single",
      "stem": "观察图 A 的 $y=2^x$。分别比较 $x:0.5\\to1.5$ 与 $1.5\\to2.5$，以及 $0.2\\to0.7$ 与 $1.2\\to1.7$ 的纵向变化量。哪项正确？",
      "figure_ids": [
        "fig-choice-growth-FIRST"
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "两组都是前一段变化更大。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "两组都是后一段变化更大。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "第一组后段更大，第二组两段相等。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "两组的两段变化量都相等。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q688-crossing",
    "source_numbers": [
      "688"
    ],
    "view": {
      "mode": "multiple",
      "stem": "图 B 在同一坐标系画出 $y=1.5^x$ 与 $y=2^x$。根据相互位置，哪些结论正确？",
      "figure_ids": [
        "fig-choice-growth-FIRST"
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "$1.5^x=2^x$ 的解集是 $\\{0\\}$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "$1.5^x<2^x$ 的解集是所有实数。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "$1.5^x<2^x$ 的解集是 $(0,+\\infty)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "$1.5^x>2^x$ 的解集是 $(-\\infty,0)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": "两个图像还会在某个 $x>0$ 处相交。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
