    "source_numbers": [
      "689"
    ],
    "view": {
      "mode": "single",
      "stem": "分别考察 $(15^x,8^x)$ 与 $(0.9^x,0.8^x)$。哪一项给出两组都适用的完整解集划分？每组关系均按“前者 $=$、$>$、$<$ 后者”的次序写出。",
      "figure_ids": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "两组均为 $\\{0\\},\\ (-\\infty,0),\\ (0,+\\infty)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "第一组为 $\\{0\\},(0,+\\infty),(-\\infty,0)$；第二组为 $\\{0\\},(-\\infty,0),(0,+\\infty)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "两组均为 $\\{0\\},\\ (0,+\\infty),\\ (-\\infty,0)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "两组均为 $\\varnothing,\\ \\mathbb R,\\ \\varnothing$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
