  {
    "id": "q697-signs",
    "source_numbers": [
      "697"
    ],
    "view": {
      "mode": "multiple",
      "stem": "每个等式中的 $k$ 分别求符号，不把不同等式的 $k$ 视为同一个数。哪些结论成立？",
      "figure_ids": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "若 $5^k=10$，则 $k>0$；若 $7^k=1.003$，也有 $k>0$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "若 $0.3^k=100$，则 $k<0$；若 $0.4^k=18$，也有 $k<0$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "若 $7^k=1.003$，则 $k=0$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "若 $0.3^k=100$，则 $k>0$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    }
  },
